---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { business, fullAddress } from '../data/site';

const reviewed = 'October 3, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Accessibility Statement | Fort Walton Beach Bowl"
  description="Fort Walton Beach Bowl's commitment to an accessible website, the standard we follow, and how to reach us if something doesn't work for you."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Accessibility" title="Accessibility statement" lede="We want everyone to be able to use this website, plan a visit and book a party." />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>Our commitment</h2>
      <p>
        {business.name} is committed to making this website usable for people of all abilities, including people who use
        screen readers, keyboard navigation, voice control, magnification or captions.
      </p>

      <h2>The standard we follow</h2>
      <p>
        This website is designed and tested to meet the
        <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/">Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2</a>, Level AA.
      </p>

      <h2>What we've done</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Clear page structure with headings, landmarks and a "Skip to main content" link.</li>
        <li>Everything works with a keyboard, with a visible focus outline.</li>
        <li>Text and background colors meet WCAG AA contrast, including on our dark "cosmic" sections.</li>
        <li>Prices, hours, specials and party details are real text, not pictures of text.</li>
        <li>Text can be enlarged to 200% without breaking the layout.</li>
        <li>Information is never shown by color alone.</li>
        <li>Form fields have labels, plain-language error messages, and errors are announced to screen readers.</li>
        <li>Animations are short, stop on their own, and switch off if your device is set to reduce motion.</li>
        <li>Buttons and links are sized for easy tapping.</li>
        <li>Pages are checked with automated tools (axe-core and Lighthouse) and by hand with a keyboard.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Other websites we link to</h2>
      <p>
        Online party reservations happen on Bowling Passport, and we also link to Facebook and Google Maps. Those sites are
        run by other companies, so we can't control how accessible they are. If you have trouble with any of them, call us
        at <a href={business.phoneHref}>{business.phone}</a> and we'll help you over the phone.
      </p>

      <h2>Tell us about a problem</h2>
      <p>
        If something on this site doesn't work for you, or you need information in a different format, please let us know.
        Tell us the page and what happened, and we'll do our best to fix it and get you what you need.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Call: <a href={business.phoneHref}>{business.phone}</a></li>
        <li>Visit or write: {fullAddress}</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Questions about getting around inside the building? Call before your visit and we'll be happy to help you plan.
      </p>

      <p class="fine-print">This statement was last reviewed on {reviewed}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .prose h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .prose li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
</style>
